      "text": "a^a=0\na^0=a\n\nprefix sum trick for handling xor in subarray \n\nprefix[i] = arr[0] ^ arr[1] ^ ... ^ arr[i];\nxor(l..r) = prefix[r] ^ prefix[l-1]\nNote that if at any given point the\nxor_prefix[i]xor_prefix[j] then sum becomes zero\n\nk=a^x_running --> by applying x_running on b.s\ntherefore a =k^x_running\n\n",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "a^a=0\na^0=a\n\nprefix sum trick for handling xor in subarray \n\nprefix[i] = arr[0] ^ arr[1] ^ ... ^ arr[i];\nxor(l..r) = prefix[r] ^ prefix[l-1]\nNote that if at any given point the xor_prefix[i]xor_prefix[j] then sum becomes zero\n\nk=a^x_running --> by applying x_running on b.s\ntherefore a =k^x_running\n\n",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
